                            <comment id="17903600" author="JIRAUSER279895" created="Fri, 6 Dec 2024 09:39:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This behaviour  (rotatedIdPart becomes &amp;gt; 127) may be reproduced in such case:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;cluster with 2+ nodes&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;cache with backups &amp;gt;= 1 and TouchedExpiryPolicy applied&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;client does massive ScanQueries which cause massive concurrent updates and recycling of memory pages (in PendingEntriesTree)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
